  "dcterms:description": "The ChEBI ontology (chebi_core.obo and related RDF/OBO files) extracted into a subject-predicate-object parquet table. Downloaded by the brick's dvc.yaml from the EMBL-EBI ChEBI FTP site (ftp://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/chebi/ontology/) and parsed into RDF triples. ChEBI is a freely available dictionary of molecular entities focused on small chemical compounds, maintained by EMBL-EBI.",
