  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude). Upstream confirmed from dvc.yaml as the EMBL-EBI ChEBI ontology FTP directory (ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/chebi/ontology/), corroborated by the README which references the ChEBI FTP README. EMBL-EBI publishes ChEBI under CC BY 4.0 (attribution). Commercial use is allowed but conditioned on attribution, hence conditional. Reviewer may confirm the exact CC BY 4.0 statement on the current ChEBI/EBI licensing page.",
